## IKernelResolver

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Core`

### Purpose
Provides access to the current `Microsoft.SemanticKernel.Kernel` instance within a kernel-scoped service. Kernel-locked (one per chat).

### Interface
```csharp
public interface IKernelResolver
{
    Func<Kernel> Resolve { get; }
}
```

### Properties
| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Resolve` | `Func<Kernel>` | Factory function that returns the current Kernel instance |

### Usage
```csharp
public class MyService
{
    private readonly IKernelResolver _resolver;

    public MyService(IKernelResolver resolver)
    {
        _resolver = resolver;
    }

    public void DoWork()
    {
        var kernel = _resolver.Resolve();
        // Use kernel...
    }
}
```

### Related
- `KernelController` - Creates and manages kernels, registers IKernelResolver
- `IKernelController` - Manages kernel lifecycle
- `Kernel` - Microsoft.SemanticKernel.Kernel instance
